The server is unchanged: \code{observe_glass(input, session)}.

\code{\link[=glass_theme]{glass_theme()}} does not remember choices (\code{persist = FALSE}).
\code{\link[=glass_page]{glass_page()}} does (\code{persist = TRUE}).
